   "why_not": "C5 subtracts only running_by_class['episodic'] from its cap and cstate classes piece and whole builds under 'recall', so a build cannot take a dashcam cap slot. And 58 to 70 percent of the epochs where a monitor goes unreleased have NO build in flight at all, so even an indirect per-epoch account fails. 156 to 180 builds per cell cannot occupy 4,400 to 5,000 epochs directly"
  },
