   ],
   "why_not": "the hypothesis predicts MORE at-risk robots under warming. The proxy counts FEWER: 261 to 562 epochs against the base's 578 to 711, because warming is what makes a robot question not at risk. And at-risk epochs touch only 6 to 12 percent of the epochs where monitors go unreleased, so the throttle cannot be holding them down. The proxy OVERSTATES at-risk periods, so this bound runs in the safe direction"
  },
